        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Estruturas de dados em árvore como a abaixo são comumente usadas no desenvolvimento de jogos para representar dados e relacionamentos de uma maneira <strong>hierárquica</strong>.</p><p>Em jogos, um gráfico de cena nos ajuda a ver como sprites, UI e efeitos estão conectados.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148943,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chamamos cada elemento de uma árvore de <strong>nó</strong>, como um nó de sprite de <code>player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148944,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Representamos objetos em uma cena de jogo como <strong>nós</strong> da árvore. Por exemplo, uma <code>scene</code> e um <code>sprite</code> são <strong>nós</strong> da árvore.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"layer\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"sprite\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;player&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"HP: 100 \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"sprite\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"layer\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;layer name=\"game\"&gt;</code> seguido de <code>&lt;sprite name=\"player\"&gt;</code> e depois <code>&lt;/sprite&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;/layer&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148945,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Existem vários tipos de nós. Chamamos <code>scene</code> de <strong>nó raiz</strong> porque é o início da árvore.</p><p>Pode haver apenas um, <strong>nó raiz</strong> de nível superior.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148946,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Elementos como <code>sprite</code> são chamados de <strong>nós de elemento</strong>. Consideramos o rótulo dentro de um <strong>nó de texto</strong> mesmo que ele não tenha o <code>&lt;</code> e <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148947,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada pedaço de texto na marcação da cena aparece como um nó de texto. Por exemplo, os textos no <code>title</code> e no <code>label</code> do HUD são nós de texto.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"102\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Dungeon Dash\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"title\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"ui\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"hud\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   Score: 0\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"label\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"hud\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"scene\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>Dungeon Dash</code> seguido de <code>Score:</code> e finalmente <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148948,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para que usamos estruturas de dados em árvore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Para representar dados e relacionamentos de forma hierárquica</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Para representar dados de forma linear</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Para representar dados e relacionamentos de forma hierárquica.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148949,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como chamamos os objetos que compõem uma árvore de cena de jogo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Nós</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ramos</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher Nós.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148950,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como a árvore de cena representa um <code>sprite</code> e um <code>label</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Como nós</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Como texto</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Como nós.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148951,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é o nó raiz desta árvore de cena do jogo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scene</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>layer</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>scene</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
